# ==============================================================================
# Mumbai AeroPulse — Environment Configuration Template (.env.example)
# Spatio-Temporal AI Airshed Intelligence & Civic Action Platform
# ==============================================================================
#
# QUICKSTART / ZERO-DEPENDENCY DEMO MODE:
# You DO NOT need API keys to run or evaluate Mumbai AeroPulse!
# If you leave both keys empty (or run without a .env file), the dashboard
# automatically activates:
#   1. Spatial GIS Engine: Interactive SVG Cartographic Fallback mapping the
#      Mumbai peninsula coastline, transport corridors, and pulsing station halos.
#   2. Generative AI Engine: High-Fidelity Context-Sensitive Synthetic Simulation
#      Engine generating ward-specific BMC municipal action plans and citizen
#      health advisories across all 4 CAAQMS monitoring stations.
#
# To enable Live Cloud Services, copy this file to `.env`:
#   cp .env.example .env
# and populate the optional keys below.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google Maps Platform API Key (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for: Live Google Maps JavaScript API with dark-theme styling,
# AdvancedMarkerElement, and particulate dispersion heatmap overlays.
#
# How to obtain:
#   1. Visit Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
#   2. Create a new Google Cloud Project or select an existing one.
#   3. Enable the following APIs & SDKs:
#        - Maps JavaScript API: https://console.cloud.google.com/marketplace/product/google/maps-backend.googleapis.com
#   4. Under "Credentials", create an API Key.
#   5. (Recommended for Production) Restrict the key by HTTP Referrer:
#        http://localhost:5173/*
#        http://localhost:4173/*
#
# Fallback Behavior:
#   If omitted, empty, or set to placeholder, the application automatically
#   renders the built-in SVG GIS Cartographic map of Mumbai with full station
#   interactivity and zero console errors.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Google Gemini AI API Key (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for: Live LLM generation of BMC Municipal Action Plans and
# Citizen & Public Health Advisories via Google AI Studio.
#
# How to obtain:
#   1. Visit Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#   2. Sign in with your Google account and click "Create API key".
#   3. Copy your API key and paste it below.
#   Note: Google AI Studio offers a generous Free Tier (up to 15 Requests Per
#   Minute for gemini-2.5-flash), requiring no billing setup.
#
# Fallback Behavior:
#   If omitted, empty, or set to placeholder, the dashboard automatically
#   engages the High-Fidelity Synthetic Simulation Engine. The synthetic engine
#   couples live micro-meteorology (PBLH, ventilation index, wind speed) with
#   station ward landmarks (Deonar in Shivaji Nagar, SGNP in Borivali, JJ Hospital
#   in Byculla, Mindspace in Malad) to produce hyper-localized action plans.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Gemini Model Name (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leave as gemini-flash-latest unless you need a specific version. Google retires
# versioned names over time; if the name set here is no longer available, the
# dashboard asks the API which models the key can use and picks one itself.
VITE_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest
